Description: mobile web interface for Prowlarr and qBittorrent
 Search configured Prowlarr indexers and manage qBittorrent downloads
 from a mobile-friendly browser interface.
 .
 This package installs a native systemd service and is intended for
 Debian 13 systems. Configure connections in
 /etc/prowlarr-mobile/prowlarr-mobile.env after installation.
